{"seq":1,"slug":"kg-enhanced-search","title":"知识图谱增强搜索","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/knowledge-graphs/kg-applications/kg-enhanced-search","wordCount":1216,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"知识图谱增强搜索\">知识图谱增强搜索</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>知识图谱增强搜索（KG-Enhanced Search）将知识图谱的结构化知识融入搜索系统的各个环节，提升搜索的语义理解、结果质量和用户体验。知识图谱为搜索提供实体识别、实体消歧、查询扩展和结构化答案展示等能力。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    Q[用户查询] --&gt; QU_S[查询理解]&#10;    QU_S --&gt; EL_S[实体链接到 KG]&#10;    EL_S --&gt; EXPAND[KG 辅助查询扩展]&#10;    EXPAND --&gt; SEARCH[搜索执行]&#10;    SEARCH --&gt; ENRICH[KG 结果增强]&#10;    ENRICH --&gt; DISPLAY[知识卡片展示]&#10;    subgraph KG 增强环节&#10;        EL_S&#10;        EXPAND&#10;        ENRICH&#10;    end\">graph TB\n    Q[用户查询] --&gt; QU_S[查询理解]\n    QU_S --&gt; EL_S[实体链接到 KG]\n    EL_S --&gt; EXPAND[KG 辅助查询扩展]\n    EXPAND --&gt; SEARCH[搜索执行]\n    SEARCH --&gt; ENRICH[KG 结果增强]\n    ENRICH --&gt; DISPLAY[知识卡片展示]\n    subgraph KG 增强环节\n        EL_S\n        EXPAND\n        ENRICH\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>增强环节</th>\n<th>KG 贡献</th>\n<th>效果</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>查询理解</td>\n<td>实体识别与消歧</td>\n<td>准确理解查询意图</td>\n<td>&quot;苹果&quot; → Apple Inc.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>查询扩展</td>\n<td>同义词/上下位词</td>\n<td>提高召回率</td>\n<td>&quot;AI&quot; → 人工智能</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>排序增强</td>\n<td>实体权威度特征</td>\n<td>优化排序质量</td>\n<td>PageRank 特征</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>结果展示</td>\n<td>知识卡片/图谱面板</td>\n<td>直接回答用户</td>\n<td>搜索 &quot;爱因斯坦&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>相关搜索</td>\n<td>图谱关联实体</td>\n<td>拓展搜索路径</td>\n<td>&quot;相关人物&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"实体链接与消歧\">实体链接与消歧</h2><p>搜索场景下的实体链接需要在极低延迟内将查询中的实体提及映射到知识图谱实体。查询文本极短、上下文有限、用户表达多样化，使得搜索场景的实体链接比文档级实体链接更具挑战。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface SearchEntityLinker {&#10;  link(query: string): Promise&lt;LinkedSearchEntity[]&gt;;&#10;  disambiguate(mention: string, context: string): Promise&lt;DisambiguationResult&gt;;&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface LinkedSearchEntity {&#10;  mention: string;&#10;  kgEntity: KGEntity;&#10;  confidence: number;&#10;  disambiguationMethod: string;&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface KGEntity {&#10;  id: string;&#10;  label: string;&#10;  type: string;&#10;  popularity: number;&#10;  description: string;&#10;  aliases: string[];&#10;}&#10;&#10;async function searchEntityLinking(&#10;  query: string,&#10;  kg: KnowledgeGraph,&#10;  popularityWeight: number = 0.3,&#10;): Promise&lt;LinkedSearchEntity[]&gt; {&#10;  const mentions = detectMentions(query);&#10;  const results: LinkedSearchEntity[] = [];&#10;&#10;  for (const mention of mentions) {&#10;    const candidates = await kg.searchEntities(mention.text, 10);&#10;&#10;    const scored = candidates.map((c) =&gt; ({&#10;      candidate: c,&#10;      score:&#10;        (1 - popularityWeight) * computeTextSimilarity(mention.text, c.label, c.aliases) +&#10;        (popularityWeight * Math.log(c.popularity + 1)) / Math.log(1000000),&#10;    }));&#10;&#10;    const best = scored.sort((a, b) =&gt; b.score - a.score)[0];&#10;    if (best &amp;&amp; best.score &gt; 0.5) {&#10;      results.push({&#10;        mention: mention.text,&#10;        kgEntity: best.candidate,&#10;        confidence: best.score,&#10;        disambiguationMethod: &#39;popularity_weighted&#39;,&#10;      });&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  return results;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> SearchEntityLinker</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  link</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">query