ark:#B392F0\"> computeTextSimilarity</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(mention.text, c.label, c.aliases) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        (popularityWeight </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Math.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(c.popularity </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Math.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1000000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> best</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> scored.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sort</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> b.score </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> a.score)[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (best </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> best.score </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      results.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">push</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        mention: mention.text,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        kgEntity: best.candidate,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        confidence: best.score,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        disambiguationMethod: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'popularity_weighted'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> results;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Google Knowledge Panel 是知识图谱增强搜索的典型应用。当用户搜索一个已知实体时，搜索结果页面右侧会展示一个知识面板，包含实体的基本属性、关联实体和相关图片。这种展示直接回答了用户的信息需求，无需点击任何搜索结果。搜索场景的实体消歧需要综合多种上下文信号。当用户搜索 &quot;苹果&quot; 时，如果搜索历史中包含 &quot;iPhone 价格&quot; 等科技类查询，则应该链接到 Apple Inc.；如果历史中包含 &quot;水果批发&quot; 等查询，则应链接到水果品类。消歧策略的优先级通常为：用户上下文 &gt; 查询上下文 &gt; 全局流行度。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>消歧信号</th>\n<th>权重优先级</th>\n<th>数据来源</th>\n<th>覆盖率</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>用户历史偏好</td>\n<td>最高</td>\n<td>搜索/点击日志</td>\n<td>老用户高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>同 Session 查询</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>会话上下文</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>查询修饰词</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>查询文本</td>\n<td>依赖表达</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>地理位置</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>GPS/IP</td>\n<td>地域相关时</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>全局流行度</td>\n<td>低（兜底）</td>\n<td>KG 统计</td>\n<td>100%</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"kg-辅助排序与推荐\">KG 辅助排序与推荐</h2><p>知识图谱为搜索排序提供丰富的结构化特征，包括实体类型、实体之间的关系、实体的图结构特征（度中心性、聚类系数）等。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface KGRankingFeatures {&#10;  entityPopularity: number;&#10;  entityTypeMatch: boolean;&#10;  pathLength: number;&#10;  commonNeighbors: number;&#10;  kgEmbeddingSimilarity: number;&#10;  entityAuthority: number;&#10;}&#10;&#10;function extractKGFeatures(queryEntity: KGEntity, docEntity: KGEntity, kg: KnowledgeGraph): KGRankingFeatures {&#10;  return {&#10;    entityPopularity: Math.log(docEntity.popularity + 1),&#10;    entityTypeMatch: queryEntity.type === docEntity.type,&#10;    pathLength: kg.shortestPath(queryEntity.id, docEntity.id)?.length ?? -1,&#10;    commonNeighbors: kg.commonNeighborCount(queryEntity.id, docEntity.id),&#10;    kgEmbeddingSimilarity: cosineSimilarity(kg.getEmbedding(queryEntity.id), kg.getEmbedding(docEntity.id)),&#10;    entityAuthority: kg.getPageRank(docEntity.id),&#10;  };&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> KGRankingFeatures</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  entityPopularity</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  entityTypeMatch</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  pathLength</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  commonNeighbors</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  kgEmbeddingSimilarity</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  entityAuthority</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> extractKGFeatures</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">queryEntity</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> KGEntity</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">docEntity</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> KGEntity</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">kg</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> KnowledgeGraph</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> KGRankingFeatures</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    entityPopularity: Math.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(docEntity.popularity </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    entityTypeMatch: queryEntity.type </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> docEntity.type,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    pathLength: kg.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">shortestPath</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(queryEntity.id, docEntity.id)?.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ??</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    commonNeighbors: kg.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">commonNeighborCount</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(queryEntity.id, docEntity.id),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    kgEmbeddingSimilarity: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">cosineSimilarity</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(kg.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getEmbedding</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(queryEntity.id), kg.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getEmbedding</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(docEntity.id)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    entityAuthority: kg.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getPageRank</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(docEntity.id),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>知识图谱在推荐场景中同样有重要应用。基于 KG 的推荐系统利用用户与物品之间的图谱路径来解释推荐理由（&quot;因为你喜欢 A 导演的电影，推荐同导演的 B&quot;），同时利用图谱的多跳连接来缓解冷启动问题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"知识图谱的实时维护\">知识图谱的实时维护</h2><p>在搜索系统中，知识图谱需要持续更新以保持信息的新鲜度。热点事件、人物变动和新实体的出现都需要实时反映到图谱中。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>更新场景</th>\n<th>时效性要求</th>\n<th>数据来源</th>\n<th>更新策略</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n</table>\n<p>知识图谱辅助排序的一个关键挑战是特征的实时性。图结构特征（如 PageRank、度中心性）可以离线计算并定期更新，但查询与文档之间的图谱路径特征需要在线实时计算。为了满足搜索延迟要求，工业系统通常预计算高频实体对之间的路径特征并缓存，对于低频查询则降级为仅使用实体级别的静态特征。</p>\n<p>| 热点事件 | 分钟级 | 新闻流 | 实时抽取+人工审核 | | 实体属性变更 | 小时级 | 权威数据源 | 定时同步 | | 新实体入库 | 天级 | 多源融合 | 批量导入 | | 关系更新 | 天级 | 抽取管线 | 增量更新 | | 图谱质量修正 | 周级 | 用户反馈 | 人工审核 |</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>知识图谱增强搜索的查询理解、排序和结果展示，提供结构化的精准答案</li>\n<li>搜索场景下的实体链接需要在极低延迟内处理短文本消歧，流行度加权是关键策略</li>\n<li>KG 为排序提供实体权威度、路径距离等结构化特征，提升排序质量</li>\n<li>知识面板（Knowledge Panel）是 KG 增强搜索的标志性产品形态</li>\n<li>搜索系统中的 KG 需要实时维护，热点事件需分钟级更新，常规数据天级更新</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读与跨学科链接\">延伸阅读与跨学科链接</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"../kg-applications/kg-search-augmentation\">知识图谱搜索增强</a>：知识面板与查询理解增强的更细化讲解</li>\n<li><a href=\"../kg-applications/kg-qa-systems\">知识图谱问答系统</a>：搜索结果页直接给答案的相邻能力</li>\n<li><a href=\"../../ai-search-retrieval/query-understanding/query-parsing\">查询解析（搜索与检索）</a>：实体识别/意图理解在通用搜索栈中的位置</li>\n<li><a href=\"../../ai-search-retrieval/search-infrastructure/search-system-architecture\">搜索系统架构（搜索与检索）</a>：KG 特征如何嵌入召回-排序的整体架构</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"知识图谱增强搜索","id":"知识图谱增强搜索"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"实体链接与消歧","id":"实体链接与消歧"},{"level":2,"text":"KG 辅助排序与推荐","id":"kg-辅助排序与推荐"},{"level":2,"text":"知识图谱的实时维护","id":"知识图谱的实时维护"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读与跨学科链接","id":"延伸阅读与跨学科链接"}],"prev":{"title":"神经网络推理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/knowledge-graphs/kg-reasoning/neural-reasoning"},"next":{"title":"知识图谱增强 LLM","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/knowledge-graphs/kg-applications/kg-enhanced-llm"}}